格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Quantum Algorithms Best Practices","id":"gh:1333823235","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"quantum-practices","slug":"unitarylab/quantum-practices","topics":["agent-skills","best-practices","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","quantum-algorithms","quantum-computing"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Quantum Algorithms Best Practices"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"⚛ Quantum-Practices"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Quantum Algorithms Best Practices"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"量子算法 最佳实践"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### What is this?"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Quantum-Practices** is a DeepSeek Harness tool bundle for quantum algorithm best practices. It pro"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"vides structured, reviewable guidance to DeepSeek Harness agents through a read-only model-facing to"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"es structured, reviewable guidance to DeepSeek Harness agents through a read-only model-facing tool."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"As a DeepSeek Harness plugin, it registers one read-only `quantum_practices` tool for listing, searc"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"hing, and reading packaged quantum algorithm practice guides from an immutable build-time catalog."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Quantum-Practices is based on and adapted from the GitHub project unitarylab/quantum-skills. The ori"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ginal project provides the quantum algorithm guide corpus; this repository reworks that foundation i"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"nto a DeepSeek Harness tool bundle with a generated, read-only practice catalog."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### ✨ Key Features"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **Progressive Disclosure** — Root `SKILL.md` is lightweight; algorithm and simulator guides load o"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"nly when needed.\n- **DeepSeek Harness Tool Bundle** — `quantum_practices` exposes `list`, `search`, "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"and `get` without executing code.\n- **Read-Only Runtime** — No network, subprocess, filesystem write"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"s, Python execution, credentials, or native code.\n- **Best-Practice Coverage** — Primitives, linear "},{"id":"p13s5","text":"systems, cryptography, Hamiltonian simulation, Schrodingerization, eigensolvers, gradients, quantum "},{"id":"p13s6","text":"machine learning, state preparation, and quantum error correction.\n- **Multi-Simulator Support** — U"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"nitaryLab (recommended), Qiskit, and PennyLane, with clear selection rules.\n- **GitHub-Sourced Corpu"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"s** — Practice guides are synchronized from the public GitHub upstream only.\n- **Education-Friendly*"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"* — Suitable for concept explanation, circuit design, code review, and hands-on demos."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 🌟 Algorithms Covered"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Category | Algorithms |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| **Primitives** | Grover, QPE, Hadamard Test, Hadamard Transform, Amplitude Amplification, Amplitud"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"e Estimation |\n| **Linear Systems** | HHL, LCU, AQC, VQLS, QSVT-QLSA, QFT, Quantum Signal Processing"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" (QSP) |\n| **Cryptography** | Shor's Algorithm, Discrete Logarithm, Simon's Algorithm |\n| **Hamilton"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ian Simulation** | Cartan decomposition, Trotter, QDrift, Taylor Series, QSP |\n| **Schrodingerizatio"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"n** | Advection, Heat (1D/2D) |\n| **Eigensolvers** | NumPyEigensolver, VQD |\n| **Gradients** | Param"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"eter-shift, Finite-difference, Linear-combination, SPSA, Reverse-mode, QFI |\n| **Quantum Machine Lea"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"rning** | VQE, VQC, QAOA, QCBM, CVQNN, Fermi-Hubbard VQE |\n| **State Preparation** | Mottonen, MPS, "},{"id":"p16s8","text":"Multiplexer, Pauli, Superposition |\n| **Quantum Error Correction** | qLDPC, CSS Codes, Hypergraph Pr"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"Pauli, Superposition |\n| **Quantum Error Correction** | qLDPC, CSS Codes, Hypergraph Product Codes |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 💻 Supported Simulators"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Simulator | When to Use | Platform |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| **UnitaryLab** *(default)* | Learning, algorithm demos, PDE workflows | Win / macOS / Linux |\n| **"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"Qiskit** | Noise models, IBM hardware workflows | Win / macOS / Linux |\n| **PennyLane** | Differenti"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"able hybrid optimization | Win / macOS / Linux |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### 📁 Repository Structure"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### DeepSeek Harness Plugin"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"For most users, install Quantum-Practices into the DeepSeek Harness profile you use, then ask your a"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"gent to consult Quantum-Practices before answering quantum algorithm questions."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"If you use the Web UI:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Restart DeepSeek Harness Web after installation."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"If you use the headless CLI:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"For local development, install this checkout directly:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"For review or release evidence, replace `main` with a pinned 40-character commit SHA."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Verify that the profile contains the inserted row:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Expected output:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Run a functional test:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"After installation, users can ask naturally. The model should call `quantum_practices` in the backgr"},{"id":"p38s2","text":" installation, users can ask naturally. The model should call `quantum_practices` in the background:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"By default, `get` returns a brief, token-conscious view with the most relevant sections. The model s"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"hould request `detail=\"full\"` only when the user needs full implementation notes, complete examples,"},{"id":"p40s3","text":" or debugging context."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Developers can also inspect the tool contract directly:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"The DSH plugin never executes `algorithms/**/scripts/*.py` and never installs or imports Python depe"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"lugin never executes `algorithms/**/scripts/*.py` and never installs or imports Python dependencies."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"### Build and Verify"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"`npm run build` regenerates `src/generated/skill-catalog.ts` and compiles the committed `lib/` relea"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"ld` regenerates `src/generated/skill-catalog.ts` and compiles the committed `lib/` release artifact."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"### Python Runtime"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"Quantum-Practices does not ship a root `requirements.txt`, bundled wheels, or a Python runtime. Any "},{"id":"p48s2","text":"Python setup belongs to the separate project where you choose to run generated examples; it is not p"},{"id":"p48s3","text":"art of the DeepSeek Harness plugin install path."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"This repository source is licensed under the MIT License."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"### ✨ 核心特性"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"- **渐进式加载** — 根 `SKILL.md` 轻量，算法与模拟器指南仅在需要时才加载。\n- **DeepSeek Harness 工具包** — `quantum_practices` 提供 "},{"id":"p52s2","text":"`list`、`search`、`get`，不执行代码。\n- **只读运行时** — 无网络、无 subprocess、无写盘、无 Python 执行、无 credentials、无 native c"},{"id":"p52s3","text":"ode。\n- **最佳实践覆盖** — 基元、线性系统、密码学、哈密顿量模拟、Schrodingerization、本征求解器、梯度方法、量子机器学习、态制备与量子纠错一应俱全。\n- **多模拟器支持"},{"id":"p52s4","text":"** — UnitaryLab（推荐）、Qiskit、PennyLane，附明确选型规则。\n- **GitHub 来源语料** — Practice guides 仅从公开 GitHub 上游同步。\n"},{"id":"p52s5","text":"- **教学友好** — 适用于概念解释、电路设计、代码审查和动手实验。"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
